# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Inputs that cannot be redistributed (size, and third-party licences).
# Neither is needed to verify the deterministic tables; both are needed only
# for --full retraining, and README.md explains how to obtain them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
assets/
out_ext/

